WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.360
Expiring soon: documents about to expire and their renewal reminders.

2
00:00:06.907 --> 00:00:09.570
Pick the period and look at the list.

3
00:00:10.115 --> 00:00:12.850
Click "Remind now" for each person.

4
00:00:13.401 --> 00:00:19.120
If the 24-hour window is closed, a follow-up ticket opens for the team to get in touch.

5
00:00:19.665 --> 00:00:26.820
Automatic reminder timing is in "Application settings"; remind earlier for documents that take long to renew.
